sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as User
  participant M as MacGuard RuleInstaller
  participant S as Channel (Pages)
  participant V as ChannelVerifier and cosign
  U->>M: update rules (consent)
  M->>M: flock update.lock, recover interrupted swaps
  M->>S: latest.json
  M->>S: tarball, manifest, bundles, proof, checkpoint, log.jsonl (byte caps)
  M->>M: safe extraction in staging
  M->>V: manifest signature, file hashes, rules_root
  M->>V: checkpoint signature, inclusion, consistency, rollback check
  V-->>M: all checks passed
  M->>M: save trusted checkpoint, rename live to previous, staging to live
  M-->>U: rules installed
